=1793896921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098220/extras/9589fa67527dd0315f8186c9eda35646.mp4?t=1793896921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run you discover better parts and worse ideas.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t make it home on your first attempt. Each run you will discover components, find the combinations that work for you and start the next run with more to play with and way more ambition. The campaign runs about 6-8 hours and no one finishes without making at least one machine that in hindsight was a mistake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or take the clock out of it entirely.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Mode removes the hazards and enemies so you can chill and enjoy exploring the “choices matter” story while taking the scenic route. There is a sandbox mode too with daily, weekly and monthly design challenges to build some rivalries with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098220/extras/c0cebf5ee1b6b0797789eab3bca3f8a1.poster.avif?t=1793896921\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098220/extras/c0cebf5ee1b6b0797789eab3bca3f8a1.webm?t=1793896921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098220/extras/c0cebf5ee1b6b0797789eab3bca3f8a1.mp4?t=1793896921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you get</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A road-trip campaign of roughly 6-8 hours, playable in full in Cozy Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire campaign in co-op with up to 3 friends; locally, or online through Steam Remote Play Together</p>